rt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}$ and $z=4.$ Express the following triple integral in cylindrical polar coordinates. \n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}V\n$$" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556346 1072 #uuid "f2ff09b0-b6eb-591a-8929-4799745e83bf" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556346 1074 "We will use the change of variables formula in the form\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,dV={∭}_{Δ}\\,f(r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,z)\\,r\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta .\n$$\n\nIf $(r,\\theta ,z)$ are the cylindrical polar coordinates of a point, then its Cartesian coordinates $(x,y,z)$ can be found by using the formulas\n\n$$\nx=r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,z=z.\n$$\n\nFirst, let's sketch the projection of $R$ onto the $xy$-plane:\n\n![](images/f8/f869ef32fb741040d355c3280da541178bcac9b52477ebfa7d078d8b832a5903.png)\n\nThe region $R$ is a right vertical cylinder of radius $\\sqrt{5}$ whose axis passes through the point $(0,0)$ in the $xy$-plane, and is\n\n- bounded below by $z=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}=r,$ and\n\n- bounded above by $z=4.$\n\nAs a result, in cylindrical polar coordinates, our region can be expressed as \n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(r,\\theta ,z)\\,:\\,0\\le r\\le \\sqrt{5},\\,0\\le \\theta <2\\pi ,\\,r\\le z\\le 4\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the change of variables formula, we obtain  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}V & ={∭}_{Δ}\\sqrt{(r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta )^{2}+(r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )^{2}}\\cdot r\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta  \\\\  & ={∭}_{Δ}r\\sqrt{{r}^{2}({cos}^{2}⁡\\theta +{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )}\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{5}}{\\int }_{r}^{4}{r}^{2}\\,dz\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556347 1080 "{\\int }_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{30}}{\\int }_{r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)}}^{r^{2} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 1}r^{2} z \\cos{\\left(2 \\theta \\right)}\\,dz\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta " 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556347 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556347 1083 #uuid "f4534025-7c2f-50e3-8205-350588ad8911" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556348 1080 "{\\int }_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}{\\int }_{0}^{4}{\\int }_{r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)}}^{r^{2} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 12}r^{3} z \\cos{\\left(2 \\theta \\right)}\\,dz\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta " 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556348 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556348 1083 #uuid "f68a34f1-2003-56dd-8559-7af6896e3609" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556289 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556290 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556318 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556327 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1075 #edb/ref 17592186556348 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1077 "selection" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1078 #edb/ref 17592186556318 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556349 1079 #uuid "f9eba1e2-1e2c-5034-83ba-ea01a4fdfe65" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556350 1068 #edb/ref 17592186556341 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556350 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556350 1071 "The region $R$ is enclosed inside the cylinder $x^2+y^2=17$ for $x\\le 0$ and $y\\ge 0$, between the surfaces $z=x$ and $z=y^{2} + 12$. Express the following triple integral in cylindrical polar coordinates.\n\n$$\n\\iiint_R z \\left(x^{2} - y^{2}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}V\n$$" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556350 1072 #uuid "fe023327-0703-5ca3-ba96-2cf3d63544fc" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556350 1074 "We will use the change of variables formula in the form\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,dV={∭}_{Δ}\\,f(r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,z)\\,r\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta .\n$$\n\nIf $(r,\\theta ,z)$ are the cylindrical polar coordinates of a point, then its Cartesian coordinates $(x,y,z)$ can be found by using the formulas\n\n$$\nx=r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,z=z.\n$$\n\nFirst, let's sketch the projection of $R$ onto the $xy$-plane:\n\n![](images/0e/0e609e4abfb4512377285af757fa4002f8e976352c72e54a808d156a781298b1.png)\n\nThe region $R$ is one-quarter of a right vertical cylinder of radius $\\sqrt{17}$ whose axis passes through the point $(0,0)$ in the $xy$-plane, and is\n\n- bounded below by $z=x=r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)},$ and\n\n- bounded above by $z=y^{2} + 12=r^{2} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 12.$\n\nAs a result, in cylindrical polar coordinates, our region can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\Delta=\\{(r,\\theta,z):0\\le r\\le \\sqrt{17},\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\le\\theta\\le \\pi,r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)}\\le z\\le r^{2} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 12\\}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, using the change of variables formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iiint_R z \\left(x^{2} - y^{2}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{d}V&=\\iiint_\\Delta z((r\\cos\\theta)^2-(r\\sin\\theta)^2)\\cdot r\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\iiint_\\Delta rz(r^2\\cos^2\\theta-r^2\\sin^2\\theta)\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\iiint_\\Delta r^3z(\\cos^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta)\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta \\\\ &=\\iiint_\\Delta r^3z\\cos(2\\theta)\\,dz\\,dr\\,d\\theta \\\\ &={\\int }_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\pi}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{17}}{\\int }_{r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)}}^{r^{2} \\sin^{2}{\\left(\\theta \\right)} + 12}r^{3} z \\cos{\\left(2 \\theta \\right)}\\,dz\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556351 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186129267.py" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true] [17592186556351 1169 #uuid "23ae31de-fa40-5998-8121-8091b0db9897" 13194139536009 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"0630c64a-1afb-51f8-84e7-89391db92821" 17592186556288 "0ebcc17a-019e-5c17-8bea-7b8844187a85" 17592186556289 "12dbab12-164b-5680-94f9-924300098671" 17592186556290 "1a89ee8e-7e15-5633-8d7b-1924dc4d1c2f" 17592186556291 "1c4f39f6-c3b9-5ce0-9e72-9d922968c0ed" 17592186556292 "24ee5f71-37f2-50d6-ae8a-9bfa2a3e68bb" 17592186556293 "2735da5a-71b8-5e58-beb0-ff742aae5ef0" 17592186556294 "2a37a2e4-2236-5089-9702-0aa3e56fadda" 17592186556295 "37475e2f-873b-54fd-b9a9-28a66b2df1fd" 17592186556296 "3ef1460b-69ae-51db-9b0f-38d59059ba70" 17592186556297 "3f055e72-6e2d-5f80-9979-e2072e2c4ca5" 17592186556298 "40378672-56df-5c9f-9860-e8215b6cd36d" 17592186556299 "4236bbd5-5775-5328-8a6a-2b03d6b4100f" 17592186556300 "45e354dd-5085-53a8-8e15-e1130241495c" 17592186556301 "46301c75-2fec-592f-826f-de2f2329166d" 17592186556302 "4d147f3c-7c7a-55fd-8060-25977335911c" 17592186556303 "4e49c3a3-9740-5bef-9bdc-6a51c7364c8e" 17592186556304 "4efc9014-7ea1-5a48-a360-c10927768451" 17592186556305 "5e3cd9a6-4a6e-5025-b51b-7ed39764e4aa" 17592186556306 "5e4f373a-a4f0-5a51-a093-838770927ab5" 17592186556307 "62da815e-5934-5e3e-9bc6-bd904287e19a" 17592186556308 "64deca10-88b4-5e7a-b5e9-5a0dc46c6381" 17592186556309 "687972b9-0c2c-5709-9a7a-2752f5b7a00d" 17592186556310 "6c764d73-7539-571d-815d-01116fae9260" 17592186556311 "6eac9f5e-670c-54d8-810c-719b5a5dbc81" 17592186556312 "6f450272-2e20-535b-a3da-b40d2daea374" 17592186556313 "727d0f0f-e7a5-5179-b828-68cc0999f3fb" 17592186556314 "7b9a55a9-e21c-5f6b-83a7-1697dde3f5a2" 17592186556315 "7c700b53-099b-567b-adf9-63c54f069d82" 17592186556316 "7d477db9-bbed-5f5c-b2cc-b2d602564666" 17592186556317 "7f2fdac7-0129-5de8-a676-0df12f29a289" 17592186556318 "7f900858-3ef0-5041-8288-ecff79ae4ae9" 17592186556319 "8cdbc979-1803-56f6-b7a0-c904c039ff8e" 17592186